## 1. Purpose

This protocol demonstrates each acceptance criterion against the approved qualification set. Acceptance is decided on a one-sided lower confidence bound, not on the observed pass rate: the observed rate is what happened in the sample, and the bound is what the sample supports as a claim about the agent.

